Subject: [PATCH 2/3] nsd: Core prediction engine

Add the NSD core prediction engine with:
  - Synaptic Markov chain table for pattern learning
  - Per-CPU ring buffer for event collection
  - Stride predictor for sequential patterns
  - Sysfs interface at /sys/kernel/nsd/
  - Prefetch worker thread

The module registers with the kernel via nsd_notify_read(),
called from filemap_read(). Prefetch uses page_cache_sync_readahead()
for proper ra_state integration.

Signed-off-by: Ayhan Aydin <nsd.project.dev@gmail.com>
